WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.190
Luffy isn't strong enough yet to become pirate
king.

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:09.349
As we now know, there is still a level above
what he's currently capable of.

00:00:09.349 --> 00:00:15.589
That goes for his devil fruit, the voice of
all things, but most importantly for his haki

00:00:15.589 --> 00:00:16.589
abilities.

00:00:16.589 --> 00:00:22.140
There are still new and even more incredible
powers for Luffy to unlock and master before

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:27.010
he can claim the throne of the pirate world
and liberate the world.

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:31.480
The final power ups he will get before the
end of the story.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:37.180
And Eiichiro Oda, the author of one piece,
has just revealed what these powers are.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:42.420
Now, saying that Luffy still isn't powerful
enough might admittedly sound like a quite

00:00:42.420 --> 00:01:15.360
bold statement after he just took out the
strongest creature in

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:20.869
the world.

00:01:20.869 --> 00:01:31.520
Kaido was physically the strongest Emperor
among the original Yonko, with an incredible

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:35.159
devil fruit power and next level haki.

00:01:35.159 --> 00:01:39.030
And Luffy managed to defeat him in a 1 vs
1 battle.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.549
So what's the problem really?

00:01:40.549 --> 00:01:47.011
Well as you well know, this fight says very
little about the enemies that are still to

00:01:47.011 --> 00:01:48.011
come.

00:01:48.011 --> 00:01:53.150
Kaido's title of the strongest creature conveniently
ignores two types of people: Those who he

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:58.789
has never fought before and those who have
just recently become stronger than him.

00:01:58.789 --> 00:02:01.990
Luffy of course falling into that latter category.

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:07.420
Someone else who just recently has surpassed
Kaido at least as far as we know, is Luffy's

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:10.110
arch nemesis Marshal D. Teach.

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:16.470
I'm sure you agree that when LUffy will inevitably
face Blackbeard at some point, it will be

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:20.830
an even harder battle for our straw hats than
the beast pirates.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:26.560
Blackbeard has not only 2 of the most powerful
devil fruits ever inn his possession, the

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:32.660
darkness fruit and the earthquake fruit, but
also has been building an army of the strongest

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:40.000
and most notorious pirates of this era, feeding
all of them powerful devil fruits.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:44.650
Luffy right now would not be able to take
on Blackbeard.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:49.600
Similarly, I think it's fair to argue that
someone like Akainu is also not going to be

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.760
an easy win for Luffy right now.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:56.840
I've discussed this in more detail in my video
on the enemies that Luffy still has to face,

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:03.030
but Luffy getting a chance to fight Sakazuki
and revenge his brother's death is almost

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:06.220
guaranteed to happen at some point in the
story.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:12.560
And he's sure to pose a real threat to anyone
who'd face him 1 vs 1.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:18.950
And then of course there is the man, the myth,
the red haired legend himself.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:25.810
Shanks has shown to us, that while he doesn't
wield a Devil fruit himself, haki wise is

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:29.390
on a completely different level from Kaido
as well.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:35.340
And that brings us already to the first major
power-up that Luffy will get now that Wano

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.340
is over.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:40.350
And for that I will also be getting into some
of the details revealed in the special one

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:44.340
piece volume 4Billion, that was distributed
for the release of film red.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:51.150
It's not related to the movie itself really,
but the info revealed about Shanks is legitimately

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:52.150
canon.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:58.290
And it's probably more than we have ever learned
about Shanks' true power in the regular story

00:03:58.290 --> 00:03:59.290
itself.

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:03.890
Shanks' conquerors haki is the strongest in
the story.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:08.390
We already pretty much knew that much, since
his legendary encounter with White Beard.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:13.570
Not only did anyone outside the top brass
of Whitebeards man faint, remember, those

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:19.480
are men who have been sailing around the new
world and are well accustomed to its dangers,

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:25.930
but simply Shanks presence there damages the
Mobby Dick, whitebeards flagship physically.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:30.450
The planks literally crack under the pressure
of his will.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:34.570
And this is Shanks coming for a peaceful chat.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:38.380
In other words, that's just his default mode.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:43.220
Luffy himself finally learned about the true
potential of conquerers Haki during his fight

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:44.220
with Kaido.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.900
He figured out to use it for fighting.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:53.560
You can coat yourself and you attacks in conquerers
haki to deal devastating blows or defend yourself

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:56.010
against your opponents attack.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:05:00.680
It's what made Kaido and Big Mom almost indestructible.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:05.870
The users kingly will manifests physically,
which is why we see the sky split whenever

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.340
two yonko meet.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:11.320
This explains why WHitebeard's ship took actual
damage.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:15.720
However Shanks takes all of this to the nest
level.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:20.590
His aura seems to be significantly larger
than that of luffy or Kaido, if it affects

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:24.570
people and objects of a 5 meter radius wherever
he goes.

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:30.420
And most terrifyingly, if you see him anywhere,
like right now, and you are not subscribed

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:33.970
to this channel he will drink all your booze.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:40.330
But Shanks isn't just passively oozing his
conquerers haki, he has control over it like

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:46.860
no other character in the story, as he impressively
demonstrated during his driveway of Wano.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:52.150
When Ryokugyuu was coming for Luffy's head
and facing off against momo and the scabbards,

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:58.860
Shanks was able to identify Aramaki's precise
location out of all people on wano at that

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:05.330
moment and direct an ultra-precise burst of
his haki towards him across many miles from

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:06.930
outside the country.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:13.960
Shanks' conquerors haki attack was so powerful
that it paralysed and scared Aramaki, forcing

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.750
him to withdraw from Wano.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:23.920
Let me repeat that: Shanks used his haki long
range to scare off a marine admiral, who had

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:26.930
just proven his terrifying strength.

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:31.550
That is a whole level above Luffy's and Kaido's
pay grade.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:37.240
But it gets even crazier: Because we have
now learned about two other of Shanks abilities

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:42.090
from the special volume 4Billion, that's probably
named after his bounty.

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:48.160
Shanks has mastered an ability called KenbunGoroshi,
referring to observation haki, which in Japanese

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:50.040
is Kenbunshoku Haki.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:52.010
Goroshi simply means killing.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:57.840
In other words, Kenbungoroshi is literally
observation haki killing.

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:02.600
It's a technique that allows shanks to use
his conquerers haki to prevents his opponent

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:05.050
form using future sight.

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:09.150
This is of course a complete game changer.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:14.840
Up to now it was always a question of who
has the stronger haki in a fight.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:20.750
However suddenly we know that it's possible
to actually nullify another persons haki using

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.210
conquerers.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:27.270
As you've probably also just thought about,
that means that someone like Katakuri who

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:32.730
has mastered his observation haki, would be
pretty much helpless against someone like

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:36.310
Shanks, completely robbed of his biggest strength.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:41.081
Especially for someone who has integrated
such an ability into his fighting style, it

00:07:41.081 --> 00:07:47.730
must come a complete shock to suddenly not
be able to rely on your most potent ability

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:48.730
anymore.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:53.699
And let's not forget that Luffy also relies
quite a bit on future sight in his fights

00:07:53.699 --> 00:07:54.890
as well at this point.

00:07:54.890 --> 00:08:00.150
But that's not all, Oda-sensei has also revealed
that Shanks is able to coat his sword Gryphon

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:04.449
in a fiery aura when fighting against his
opponents.

00:08:04.449 --> 00:08:11.530
And we do know for a fact that neither Shanks
nor any of his men have eaten a devil fruit.

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:16.790
So, Correct me if I'm wrong, but to me that
sounds like either one of two things: Either

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:23.330
shanks sword has eaten a devil fruit, which
would be pretty sick by itself, or, OR, Shanks

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:27.620
is able to generate flames with his Haki.

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:30.250
What does that remind you of?

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:38.830
Exactly, Luffy's mysterious fire powers he
uses with red hawk and red rock.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:44.490
Shanks has opened up an entire new level of
power and fighting in one piece to us and

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:50.800
as you well know, Luffy won't be able to become
pirate king without reaching that same level

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:51.800
as well.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:55.870
No matter if Shanks is actually chasing the
one piece himself or whether he will simply

00:08:55.870 --> 00:09:02.029
test Luffy's power, I made a whole video on
that as well, reaching this level of mastery

00:09:02.029 --> 00:09:07.960
over his conquerers haki will be a must for
Luffy now that he is moving towards the final

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:08.960
island.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:14.120
But Haki isn't the only thing that our captain
still has room to grow in.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:17.050
There are still other power-ups waiting for
us.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.820
Like with Luffy's devil fruit.

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:26.029
Yes, Luffy has just awakened his fruit and
used his gear 5 for the first time, which

00:09:26.029 --> 00:09:28.740
he himself called his pinnacle.

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:34.750
However, Luffy's devil fruit awakening was
active for a couple of minutes at the peak

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.270
of his fight with Kaido.

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:41.170
I think it's pretty fair to say, that Luffy
has not mastered the true potential of the

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:42.960
Nika devil fruit yet.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:48.720
What we saw him do with it was incredibly
impressive, absolutely, but I think that there

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:55.790
must be more to its true power and potential
for the Gorosei to want to erase it form history.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:59.580
The ability to shape its surroundings and
the fact that Luffy has been revealed to be

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:03.930
a zoan fruit open up so many possibilities.

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:06.520
What exactly IS gear 5 even?

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.589
Is it Nika awakened?

00:10:08.589 --> 00:10:13.790
Is it simply Luffy's transformed form into
Nika?

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:15.440
What does his hybrid form look like?

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:22.400
As you can see, there are still so many unanswered
questions and things we don't know yet about

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:23.720
the Nika fruit.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:29.440
And Luffy himself doesn'T even know yet, that
he is a Zoan user.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:34.700
Once he finds out, he will be able to do so
much more with it, than right now.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:40.010
I think we really only have seen the beginning
of what this devil fruit is truly capable

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:45.850
of and why it plays such an important role
in taking down the world government and changing

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:46.850
the world.

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:50.779
Then of course, there is the voice of all
things.

00:10:50.779 --> 00:10:57.110
This power is still incredibly mysterious
and seems to be even rarer than having conqueror's

00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:58.110
haki.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:01.040
Luffy so far has used it only in a very limited
way.

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:06.620
He is able to detect peoples true feelings
and intentions and is able to communicate

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:07.620
with animals.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:13.460
Which is a huge deal, don't get me wrong,
but there must be more to this mysterious

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:20.310
power, that might well be related to the D.
Clan itself, since Roger had it as well.

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:24.280
We do know for example, that Roger was able
to understand the poneglyphs to a certain

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:27.000
degree using this ability.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:30.480
So what else is it capable of?

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:35.970
It might actually be the key to finding and
using the one piece.

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:38.590
The secret ability of the D clan.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:42.620
And let's not forget the ancient weapons.

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:48.640
We know that Poseidon, Pluton and Uranus are
all connected to Joy Boy and the void century.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:53.270
All three are powerful enough to destroy the
world.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:56.940
Terrible Weapons that can be used for either
good or bad.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:02.860
But in the end, it sounds like Luffy will
be needing them in order to fulfil his dream

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:07.240
and create a new world where everyone is free
to live a happy life.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:10.320
These 3 weapons are truly mysterious.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:15.630
However, we might already know what their
secret is and how they work.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:21.510
These weapons might be more complex and sophisticated
than we all could have dreamed.

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:27.450
They seem to include genetic engineering,
gigantuous monsters and colossal vessels.

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:34.440
And if you really want to learn how they might
work, you really shouldn't skip this video

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:34.959
right here.

